  name: Add product
  description: Creates a new product with complete details. This includes the product title, description, specifications (like size, color, features), pricing, discount information, stock quantity, and multiple product images. The system automatically calculates the final price after applying discounts, generates a slug from the title, and stores images in cloud storage. Each product is automatically linked to its brand, sub-category, and category.
  
